abstract: "Diagnosis-origin dynamic competing-risk survivorship, matched population RMST deficit, age/sex-standardized pathology contrasts, unified-cohort sensitivity, descriptive surgery-code audit and L0 non-PH sensitivity. Current-manuscript and full-run limitations are explicit; no patient-level SEER data are distributed."
